          "snippet": {
            "line": 47,
            "text": "theorem jetRate_of_log_bound {l : Filter E} {q : E → ℝ} {f : E → V}\n    (hq : ∀ᶠ x in l, 0 < q x) (hqzero : Tendsto q l (𝓝 0))\n    (m : ℕ) (C P r : ℝ)\n    (hb : ∀ᶠ x in l, ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ m f x‖ ≤\n      C * (1 + |Real.log (q x)|) ^ P * q x ^ r) :\n    JetRate l q f m (r - 1)"
          }
